  "Connects to {2}:{3} over PDP context {0} and SSL context {1}; this connection's clientID is {4}; ",
  "Closes clientID {0} with close_timeout set to {1}",
  "Closes the SSL connection on clientID {0}; with no timeout parameter the default of 10 seconds applies; ",
  " seconds",
  ". The immediate OK only means the command was accepted — success or failure arrives in the +QSSLOPEN URC",
