  "trailing 0 = buffer mode, you fetch the data yourself with AT+QSSLRECV",
  "trailing 1 = direct push, incoming data comes straight out in a +QSSLURC together with its content, no separate read",
  "trailing 2 = transparent mode, the AT port becomes the data channel",
